From: jonas@msiw30.msi.se (Jonas Hvarfner)
Subject: Re: How to make shared libraries ?
Date: 1995/07/21
Message-ID: <3unpur$4g8@news.kth.se>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 106869384
references: <3ukf4i$903@uwm.edu>
