PAUL D. CHAPIN <pdchapin@news.amherst.edu> wrote:
>Given that I have to change upwards of ten passwords a week of users
>who have forgotten theirs, this approach is not acceptable.  If
>there's no easy work around, NIS is dead on this campus.  Personally,
>I'm not going to bring a system into the NIS happy family unless I
>trust the root. Since I'm root on every system here, that's not a real
