>
>Anyone know the what the problem with this is?

Digital Unix comes with an entry in /etc/services for webster that specifies
a different port than the one you want to use.  In /etc/services change
the line to look like this:

dictionary     10300/tcp

or remove it.  If you're using NIS, you probably want to rebuilt the
services map after doing this.


